---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../../styles/global.css';
---

<Base title="Color Harmony — варианты палитры АйДаКемп" noindex>

<style is:inline>
  body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: #f7f8fb; }
  .pal-section { padding: 60px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
  .pal-section h2 { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #0d1a2b; }
  .pal-desc { color: #4b5263; max-width: 720px; margin-bottom: 24px; font-size: 15px; }
  .swatch-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .swatch { width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08); display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: center; font-size: 9px; color: white; padding: 4px; text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); font-weight: 600; }
  .swatch-light { color: #0d1a2b; text-shadow: none; }
  .demo-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; max-width: 720px; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .demo-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .demo-card { padding: 20px; border-radius: 14px; }
  .demo-button { padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 12px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; border: none; transition: all 0.2s; }
  .demo-tag { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
  .label { font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; opacity: 0.7; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .nav { position: sticky; top: 0; background: white; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; padding: 12px 24px; z-index: 10; }
  .nav a { margin-right: 16px; color: #ec7c00; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; }
</style>

<nav class="nav">
  <a href="#current">⚠️ Сейчас (хаос)</a>
  <a href="#v1">1. Complementary</a>
  <a href="#v2">2. Analogous</a>
  <a href="#v3">3. Triadic</a>
  <a href="#v4">4. Split-complementary ⭐</a>
</nav>

<!-- ═══ CURRENT (CHAOS) ═══ -->
<section id="current" class="pal-section" style="background: #fff;">
  <h2 style="color: #c45f00;">⚠️ Сейчас в проекте — 6 разных hue в hero</h2>
  <p class="pal-desc">Trust иконки в emerald/rose/sky + amber акцент + primary orange + navy + slate texts = "новогодняя ёлка"</p>

  <div class="swatch-row">
    <div class="swatch" style="background:var(--color-primary);">orange</div>
    <div class="swatch" style="background:#fcd34d;" >amber</div>
    <div class="swatch" style="background:#6ee7b7;">emerald</div>
    <div class="swatch" style="background:#fda4af;">rose</div>
    <div class="swatch" style="background:#7dd3fc;">sky</div>
    <div class="swatch" style="background:#0d1a2b;">navy</div>
    <div class="swatch" style="background:#64748b;">slate</div>
  </div>

  <div class="demo-grid">
    <div class="demo-card" style="background: #0d1a2b; color: white;">
      <div class="label" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7)">HERO</div>
      <h3 style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 22px;">Летний IT-лагерь — для детей <span style="color:#fcd34d;">7-15 лет</span></h3>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 14px;">Пока другие на даче — ваш сделает <span style="color:var(--color-primary); font-weight: 700;">AI-проект</span></p>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <span class="demo-tag" style="background: rgba(110,231,183,0.2); color: #6ee7b7;">✓ Лицензия</span>
        <span class="demo-tag" style="background: rgba(253,164,175,0.2); color: #fda4af;">♥ 24/7</span>
        <span class="demo-tag" style="background: rgba(125,211,252,0.2); color: #7dd3fc;">⛨ Страховка</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-card" style="background: white; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
      <div class="label">CTA BUTTON</div>
      <button class="demo-button" style="background: var(--color-primary); color: white;">Записаться</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ VARIANT 1: COMPLEMENTARY ═══ -->
<section id="v1" class="pal-section" style="background: #fff;">
  <h2>1. Complementary — orange + blue (180°)</h2>
  <p class="pal-desc">Классика. Контраст orange/blue. Подходит SaaS, B2B, but для kids — слегка холодновато.</p>

  <div class="swatch-row">
    <div class="swatch" style="background:var(--color-primary);">primary</div>
    <div class="swatch" style="background:#006bf5;">complement</div>
    <div class="swatch" style="background:#0d1a2b;">navy</div>
    <div class="swatch swatch-light" style="background:#e5e7eb;">neutral</div>
    <div class="swatch" style="background:#16a34a;">success</div>
    <div class="swatch" style="background:#dc2626;">error</div>
  </div>

  <div class="demo-grid">
    <div class="demo-card" style="background: #0d1a2b; color: white;">
      <div class="label" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7)">HERO</div>
      <h3 style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 22px;">Летний IT-лагерь — для детей <span style="color:#006bf5;">7-15 лет</span></h3>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 14px;">Пока другие на даче — ваш сделает <span style="color:var(--color-primary); font-weight: 700;">AI-проект</span></p>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <span class="demo-tag" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.10); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);">✓ Лицензия</span>
        <span class="demo-tag" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.10); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);">♥ 24/7</span>
        <span class="demo-tag" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.10); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);">⛨ Страховка</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-card" style="background: white; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
      <div class="label">CTA BUTTON</div>
      <button class="demo-button" style="background: var(--color-primary); color: white;">Записаться</button>
      <button class="demo-button" style="background: #006bf5; color: white; margin-left: 8px;">Узнать больше</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ VARIANT 2: ANALOGOUS ═══ -->
<section id="v2" class="pal-section" style="background: #fff;">
  <h2>2. Analogous — тёплая палитра (orange + amber + red-orange)</h2>
  <p class="pal-desc">Дружелюбно, тепло. Для kids camp работает хорошо. Минус: всё выглядит «оранжево», нет cool-акцента для IT-фишек.</p>

  <div class="swatch-row">
    <div class="swatch" style="background:var(--color-primary);">primary</div>
    <div class="swatch" style="background:#ffb300;">amber</div>
    <div class="swatch" style="background:#f76b3a;">red-orange</div>
    <div class="swatch" style="background:#0d1a2b;">navy</div>
    <div class="swatch swatch-light" style="background:#fff8f2;">warm-bg</div>
    <div class="swatch" style="background:#16a34a;">success</div>
  </div>

  <div class="demo-grid">
    <div class="demo-card" style="background: #0d1a2b; color: white;">
      <div class="label" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7)">HERO</div>
      <h3 style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 22px;">Летний IT-лагерь — для детей <span style="color:#ffb300;">7-15 лет</span></h3>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 14px;">Пока другие на даче — ваш сделает <span style="color:var(--color-primary); font-weight: 700;">AI-проект</span></p>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <span class="demo-tag" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.10); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);">✓ Лицензия</span>
        <span class="demo-tag" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.10); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);">♥ 24/7</span>
        <span class="demo-tag" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.10); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);">⛨ Страховка</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-card" style="background: #fff8f2; border: 1px solid var(--color-primary);">
      <div class="label">CTA BUTTON</div>
      <button class="demo-button" style="background: var(--color-primary); color: white;">Записаться</button>
      <button class="demo-button" style="background: #ffb300; color: #0d1a2b; margin-left: 8px;">Узнать больше</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ VARIANT 3: TRIADIC ═══ -->
<section id="v3" class="pal-section" style="background: #fff;">
  <h2>3. Triadic — orange + magenta + cyan (3 равноудалённых)</h2>
  <p class="pal-desc">Ярко, активно. Для kids подходит, но рискованно — может выглядеть «детски» а не премиум.</p>

  <div class="swatch-row">
    <div class="swatch" style="background:var(--color-primary);">primary</div>
    <div class="swatch" style="background:#ec00b4;">magenta</div>
    <div class="swatch" style="background:#00b4ec;">cyan</div>
    <div class="swatch" style="background:#0d1a2b;">navy</div>
    <div class="swatch" style="background:#16a34a;">success</div>
  </div>

  <div class="demo-grid">
    <div class="demo-card" style="background: #0d1a2b; color: white;">
      <div class="label" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7)">HERO</div>
      <h3 style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 22px;">Летний IT-лагерь — для детей <span style="color:#00b4ec;">7-15 лет</span></h3>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 14px;">Пока другие на даче — ваш сделает <span style="color:var(--color-primary); font-weight: 700;">AI-проект</span></p>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <span class="demo-tag" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.10); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);">✓ Лицензия</span>
        <span class="demo-tag" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.10); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);">♥ 24/7</span>
        <span class="demo-tag" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.10); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);">⛨ Страховка</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-card" style="background: white; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
      <div class="label">CTA BUTTON</div>
      <button class="demo-button" style="background: var(--color-primary); color: white;">Записаться</button>
      <button class="demo-button" style="background: #ec00b4; color: white; margin-left: 8px;">Hot Deal</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ VARIANT 4: SPLIT-COMPLEMENTARY ═══ -->
<section id="v4" class="pal-section" style="background: #fff8f2;">
  <h2>⭐ 4. Split-complementary — orange + teal + mint (Apple-style premium)</h2>
  <p class="pal-desc">Баланс тепла (orange) и свежести (teal/mint). Premium feel + IT/digital ассоциация. Это то что предлагаю.</p>

  <div class="swatch-row">
    <div class="swatch" style="background:var(--color-primary);">primary</div>
    <div class="swatch" style="background:#00b4d4;">accent-teal</div>
    <div class="swatch" style="background:#00d490;">mint</div>
    <div class="swatch" style="background:#0d1a2b;">navy</div>
    <div class="swatch swatch-light" style="background:#f7f8fb;">neutral</div>
    <div class="swatch" style="background:#dc2626;">error</div>
  </div>

  <div class="demo-grid">
    <div class="demo-card" style="background: #0d1a2b; color: white;">
      <div class="label" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7)">HERO</div>
      <h3 style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 22px;">Летний IT-лагерь — для детей <span style="color:#00b4d4;">7-15 лет</span></h3>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 14px;">Пока другие на даче — ваш сделает <span style="color:var(--color-primary); font-weight: 700;">AI-проект</span></p>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <span class="demo-tag" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.10); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);">✓ Лицензия</span>
        <span class="demo-tag" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.10); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);">♥ 24/7</span>
        <span class="demo-tag" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.10); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);">⛨ Страховка</span>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: 16px; padding: 12px; background: rgba(0,180,212,0.15); border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0,180,212,0.3);">
        <div style="font-size: 11px; opacity: 0.7; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em;">Спросите бота про</div>
        <div style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #00b4d4;">минусы</div>
        <div style="font-size: 11px; opacity: 0.6; margin-top: 4px;">⛨ Анонимно, без регистрации</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-card" style="background: white; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
      <div class="label">CTA BUTTON</div>
      <button class="demo-button" style="background: var(--color-primary); color: white;">Записаться</button>
      <button class="demo-button" style="background: white; color: #0d1a2b; border: 1.5px solid #00b4d4; margin-left: 8px;">Узнать больше</button>
      <div style="margin-top: 16px; padding: 12px; background: rgba(0,212,144,0.1); border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0,212,144,0.3);">
        <span style="color: #00d490; font-weight: 700;">✓ Сейчас доступно 14 мест</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="pal-desc" style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <strong>Где что использовать:</strong><br>
    🟠 <code>primary (orange)</code> — главные CTA, цена, акценты «AI-проект»<br>
    🟦 <code>teal #00b4d4</code> — IT-фишки, бот, info-блоки, secondary CTA<br>
    🌿 <code>mint #00d490</code> — success states, "доступно", checkmarks<br>
    🟦 <code>navy</code> — hero bg, premium feeling<br>
    ⬜ <code>neutral</code> — body text, borders<br>
    🔴 <code>red</code> — error only
  </p>
</section>

<section style="padding: 40px 24px; text-align: center; color: #4b5263; font-size: 13px;">
  <p>👉 Какой вариант выбираем для AidaCamp?</p>
  <p style="margin-top: 8px;"><strong>Моя рекомендация: ⭐ Variant 4 (Split-complementary)</strong> — orange + teal + mint</p>
</section>

</Base>
